assets/phyllon-mark.svg is brand/logo-mono.svg of Phyllon, the author's own
project, which is free software under the same license, the GNU Affero General
Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version. It is copied
unchanged.

assets/nixos-logomark.svg is the NixOS logomark. It is derived from
logo/nix-snowflake-colours.svg of NixOS/nixos-artwork (the file that the
nixos-icons package installs as nix-snowflake.svg), at revision
9d2cdedd73d64a068214482902adea3d02783ba8.

  Title:   NixOS logomark (nix-snowflake)
  Author:  Simon Frankau (original design), revised by Tim Cuthbertson
  Source:  https://github.com/NixOS/nixos-artwork/blob/9d2cdedd73d64a068214482902adea3d02783ba8/logo/nix-snowflake-colours.svg
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes: colors changed. The gradient fills are replaced by two classes, one
for each set of three arms, whose fills backdrop takes from the theme (Mauve
and Blue); a title element is added; the editor's metadata is dropped. The
shapes, their rotations and their proportions are the original's, and backdrop
draws the logo without rotating, mirroring, cropping or distorting it, with a
clear space of at least a quarter of its height between it and the facts. The
credit implies no endorsement by the NixOS project.
